{"type":"before","callId":"call@202","startTime":91689.056,"class":"Frame","method":"fill","params":{"selector":"input[placeholder=\"Add your own…\"] >> nth=0","strict":true,"value":"This survey should track the gaming brand 'Epic Games' and its flagship game 'Fortnite', as well as the broader gaming market context of the battle royale genre. Epic Games is a prominent gaming company known for developing and publishing Fortnite, a highly popular and influential battle royale game that has revolutionized the gaming industry with its unique blend of gameplay mechanics, engaging visuals, and massive player base. The game's massive success has led to a significant increase in the popularity of the battle royale genre, with numerous other games attempting to replicate its success. By tracking Epic Games and Fortnite, this survey can gain valuable insights into the gaming preferences and behaviors of players, as well as the broader market trends and shifts in the gaming industry. Additionally, the survey can also explore the impact of Fortnite's in-game purchases, seasonal updates, and collaborations with other brands on player engagement and spending habits. Furthermore, the survey can also delve into the competitive landscape of the battle royale genre, including the market share and player base of other popular games such as PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds (PUBG) and Apex Legends, to provide a comprehensive understanding of the gaming market and its trends.","timeout":0},"stepId":"pw:api@124","pageId":"page@4e202ed6ccaef4078e01366fc6b6b2fa","beforeSnapshot":"before@call@202"}
