auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},[[287,43]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},[[287,75]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},[[287,79]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full justify-start items-start flex-col mt-[8px] h-[24px] relative overflow-visible","style":"opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between items-start pointer-events-none","style":"opacity: 1;"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] -ml-[5px] pointer-events-auto"},[[287,81]],["BUTTON",{"class":"relative group flex items-center justify-center w-[24px] h-[24px] rounded-[8px] overflow-visible opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed","disabled":""},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"flex-shrink-0 bg-[#808080] transition-colors duration-200 ","style":"width: 14px; height: 14px; mask-image: url(\"/icons/retry_2.svg\"); mask-size: contain; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-position: center center;"}]]]]],[[287,87]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-end pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0 mb-4 mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":" justify-center mt-6 mb-6 items-start w-full bg-[#F7FBFF] rounded-[12px] border border-[#C4C7C780] "},["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"1"],". ","Which gaming brand, game, publisher, platform, or category should this survey track? Please describe the brand set and the market context."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"This survey should track the gaming brand 'Epic Games' and its flagship game 'Fortnite', as well as the broader gaming market context of the battle royale genre. Epic Games is a prominent gaming company known for developing and publishing Fortnite, a highly popular and influential battle royale game that has revolutionized the gaming industry with its unique blend of gameplay mechanics, engaging visuals, and massive player base. The game's massive success has led to a significant increase in the popularity of the battle royale genre, with numerous other games attempting to replicate its success. By tracking Epic Games and Fortnite, this survey can gain valuable insights into the gaming preferences and behaviors of players, as well as the broader market trends and shifts in the gaming industry. Additionally, the survey can also explore the impact of Fortnite's in-game purchases, seasonal updates, and collaborations with other brands on player engagement and spending habits. Furthermore, the survey can also delve into the competitive landscape of the battle royale genre, including the market share and player base of other popular games such as PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds (PUBG) and Apex Legends, to provide a comprehensive understanding of the gaming market and its trends."]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"2"],". ","Which gaming behaviors should the survey cover? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Mobile game usage frequency and session patterns, Game genres, titles, and platform choices, In-app purchases and spending behavior, Reasons for switching, uninstalling, or returning, Social, multiplayer, and community behavior"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"3"],". ","Which brand-health measures matter most? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Unaided and aided awareness, Familiarity and consideration, Current usage and recent usage, Brand associations and differentiation, Loyalty, advocacy, and likelihood to continue"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"4"],". ","Who should answer the survey? Select all that apply."],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Current mobile gamers, Occasional or lapsed mobile gamers, Players of the tracked brand or game, Players of competing games, Parents or household decision-makers for younger players"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"5"],". ","What is the single most important decision this research should support?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Guide marketing, partnerships, or campaign strategy"]],["DIV",{"class":"border-b-[#C4C7C74D] px-5 md:px-4 py-2 border-b last:border-b-0"},["H2",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[16px] md:text-[18px] leading-[28px] lg:leading-[28px] text-[#1A1C1C] behindtheninetiesmd_75847852-module__RF1Ruq__className"},["SPAN",{},"6"],". ","Is this intended as a one-time study or a recurring tracking survey, and when do you need the first wave completed?"],["P",{"class":"allow-text-select text-[14px] md:text-[15px] leading-[24px] text-[#444748] mb-2 font-inter"},"Two or more planned waves"]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"mt-2 flex w-full min-w-0 max-w-full flex-col ml-0 sm:ml-[12px]","style":"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8.49478px);"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 w-full max-w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full min-w-0 max-w-full mt-[12px]"},["STYLE",{},"\n/* One sweep (~2.7s), then a ~0.3s rest, per 3s iteration. The travel is exactly one\n   tile period (background-size 200% → a 200% shift), so the loop point is\n   seamless. The rest frames hold at 200% ≡ 0%, where the visible window shows\n   only the gradient's flat #B8B8B8 half (highlight lives in the 50–100% stops),\n   so nothing is frozen mid-text during the pause — the text just sits gray. */\n@keyframes ws-shimmer-sweep { 0% { background-position: 0% 0; animation-timing-function: ease-in-out; } 90% { background-position: 200% 0; } 100% { background-position: 200% 0; } }\n@keyframes ws-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }\n@keyframes ws-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }\n.ws-fade-in { animation: ws-fade-in 0.45s ease-out both; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-shimmer","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal","style":"display: inline-block; background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(70, 70, 70) 0%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 50%, rgb(184, 184, 184) 75%, rgb(70, 70, 70) 100%); background-size: 200% 100%; background-repeat: repeat; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; animation: 3s linear 0s infinite normal none running ws-shimmer-sweep;"},"This may take a minute"]]]]]],["DIV",{"style":"height: 300px;"}],[[305,191]]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"questionnaire-floating-anchor","class":"w-full relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mb-[19px] md:mt-0 "},["DIV",{"class":"border border-transparent w-full max-w-[800px] flex flex-col"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex justify-center"},["DIV",{"class":"relative w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center"},[[305,196]],["DIV",{"class":" w-full bg-white md:w-full shadow-[0px_1px_42px_0px_#00000012] border-[0.6px] border-[#BFBFBF] rounded-[12px] md:rounded-[20px] px-[10px] md:px-5 py-[10px] md:py-4 sticky bottom-5 z-10   overflow-visible max-w-[800px] max-h-[460px]"},[[305,198]],["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center justify-between  mt-[24px]"},[[305,210]],["DIV",{"class":"relative"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"relative inline-flex group"},["BUTTON",{"aria-label":"submit button","class":"flex w-9 h-9 md:w-8 md:h-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] p-[7px_7.9px_7.6px_7px] shadow-none md:shadow-[0px_4px_8px_0px_#00000026] transition-transform will-change-transform ease-[cubic-bezier(0.165,0.85,0.45,1)] duration-150 hover:scale-y-[1.015] hover:scale-x-[1.005] active:scale-[0.985] hover:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.20),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] active:bg-[radial-gradient(at_bottom,hsla(0_0%_100%_/0.28),hsla(0_0%_100%_/0))] cursor-pointer caret-black bg-black -mb-[2px]"},["DIV",{"class":"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center","style":""},["DIV",{"class":"w-2 h-2 bg-black rounded-[1px]"}]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[321,507]],[[321,508]],[[321,509]]],[[321,656]],[[287,151]],[[305,236]],[[287,152]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":133275.242,"wallTime":1786696022250,"collectionTime":2.400000005960