rt pointer-events-auto  w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-[96%] mx-[2%]"},[[88,3]],["DIV",{"class":"flex w-full "},["DIV",{"class":"flex rounded-[8px] bg-transparent text-[#464646] w-full flex-shrink-0  mt-2"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"mb-8 pointer-events-auto"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full max-w-[800px] mt-[12px]"},[[88,5]],[[88,14]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},[[88,29]],[[88,44]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},[[88,48]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},[[88,51]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 max-w-full break-words"},["DIV",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className mt-3 min-w-0 max-w-full break-words text-[12px] text-[#464646] leading-[160%]"},["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"1. Core Objective & Business Context"],[[88,54]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Business problem:"]," Track the strength of Epic Games and Fortnite among Indian mobile gamers within the wider battle royale market, while understanding how usage, social play, live-service updates, collaborations, and in-game spending influence brand loyalty."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why this matters now:"]," Fortnite competes in a fast-moving category where player attention can shift between titles such as Fortnite, BGMI/PUBG, Free Fire, and Apex Legends. A recurring tracker is needed to distinguish short-term campaign or season effects from durable changes in awareness, consideration, usage, loyalty, and competitive position."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Decision enabled:"]," The research will guide marketing, partnership, collaboration, campaign, community, and retention strategy by showing which audiences are most valuable, what keeps them engaged, and where Fortnite is gaining or losing relevance."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Tracking principle:"]," Maintain an identical core brand-health module across waves, while allowing a small rotating module for current campaigns, collaborations, seasonal updates, monetisation initiatives, or emerging competitors."],"\n"],[[88,77]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"2. Secondary Research Snapshot"],[[88,80]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Mobile remains a major growth and monetisation engine:"]," Newzoo forecasts mobile games revenue to reach $121.1 billion in 2026, indicating that mobile engagement and monetisation should remain central measures in this tracker. — Newzoo. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://newzoo.com/articles/global-games-market-2025","node":"[object Object]"},"newzoo.com"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"The global games market continues to expand:"]," Newzoo estimates the global games market at $188.8 billion in 2025, with growth shaped by changing platform dynamics and continued mobile monetisation. This supports tracking platform choice and movement between mobile, PC, and console rather than treating mobile behavior in isolation. — Newzoo. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://newzoo.com/articles/global-games-market-189-billion-2025/","node":"[object Object]"},"newzoo.com"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Battle royale is a multi-title competitive ecosystem:"]," Newzoo’s battle royale analysis specifically compares leading PC and mobile titles and identifies regional differences in Fortnite and PUBG performance. The study should therefore measure unaided awareness, aided awareness, usage, consideration, and perceived differentiation across the competitive set. — Newzoo. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://resources.newzoo.com/the-rise-of-battle-royale","node":"[object Object]"},"resources.newzoo.com"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"India is a high-reach but relatively low-monetisation gaming market:"]," Available market reporting describes India as a very large mobile-download market, while revenue per player remains comparatively low. This makes payment behavior, purchase conversion, spend occasions, and barriers to spending important tracking variables rather than relying only on stated loyalty. — Sensor Tower reporting summarized by Game Developer Reports. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://gamedevreports.substack.com/i/167151250/market-overview","node":"[object Object]"},"gamedevreports.substack.com"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"In-game monetisation and brand integrations are becoming more important in India:"]," Recent Indian gaming coverage reports rising average revenue among paying users and a projected shift toward greater in-app-purchase contribution. The tracker should connect spending with perceived value, cosmetics, events, collaborations, and engagement rather than measuring spend as a standalone behavior. — The Economic Times, citing the Bitkraft–Redseer report. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"http://economictimes.indiatimes.com/industry/media/entertainment/online-gaming-india-krafton-bgmi-rooter-bitkraft-redseer-nazara-in-app-purchases-driving-growth/articleshow/126368318.cms","node":"[object Object]"},"economictimes.indiatimes.com"],")"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Fortnite’s ecosystem extends beyond the core battle royale mode:"]," Epic’s creator-economy model distributes engagement-based revenue to eligible island creators, making creator-made experiences and social participation relevant parts of Fortnite’s brand proposition. — Epic Games. (",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://www.fortnite.com/news/introducing-the-creator-economy-2-0","node":"[object Object]"},"fortnite.com"],", ",["A",{"class":"text-[#1A73E8] hover:underline","href":"https://www.fortnite.com/news/fortnite-engagement-payout-update?lang=en-US","node":"[object Object]"},"fortnite.com"],")"],"\n"],[[88,134]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"3. Research Type & Methodology"],[[88,137]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Study type:"]," Brand Health / Tracking combined with Usage & Attitude, Competitive Landscape, and selected Customer Experience-style engagement measures."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Discrete stimuli counted:"]," Zero. The study is tracking existing brands, behaviors, perceptions, and market participation; it does not require respondents to evaluate specific advertisements, packs, concepts, or other discrete stimuli."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Research design:"]," A linear, modular tracking questionnaire with a consistent core across waves. Cell-based designs such as monadic, sequential monadic, A/B, paired comparison, and split-cell testing do not apply because there are no discrete stimuli to show."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why this approach:"]," The central decision is to monitor movement in brand health and explain why that movement occurs. A modular tracking design will provide clean wave-to-wave comparison while linking awareness and consideration to actual play frequency, recent usage, switching, social behavior, live-service engagement, and spending."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Alternatives considered:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Single-wave U&A study:"]," Useful for a broad behavioral snapshot, but weaker for identifying whether Fortnite’s position is improving or declining over time."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Concept or campaign testing:"]," Appropriate when specific creative or partnership assets must be evaluated, but not suitable for the current always-on brand-health objective."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Segmentation-first study:"]," Could identify player personas in depth, but should follow the tracker or use a limited attitudinal battery because the immediate priority is monitoring brand and competitive movement."],"\n"],"\n"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"User control:"]," If you prefer a different methodology, such as a standalone campaign test or a deeper player segmentation study, it can be switched before the research brief is generated."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Survey design logic:"]," Use a modular funnel: category behavior before brand measures; unaided awareness before aided awareness; usage before attitudes; attitudes before loyalty and advocacy; and behavioral spend questions before asking for explanations. Keep the core battery stable across waves and rotate only timely modules such as seasonal updates, major collaborations, creator experiences, or campaign exposure."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Wave design:"]," Establish a baseline wave, then repeat the core instrument in subsequent waves. Use identical wording and scales for trend KPIs. Add wave identifiers and field-period markers so changes can be interpreted alongside season launches, partnerships, esports moments, and major product updates."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Indian panel and device context:"]," Surveys will be deployed to verified Indian respondents through the SuperJ mobile application and web. Age, gender, city, and NCCS targeting will be enforced by the audience system before the survey begins, so these should not be re-collected in the questionnaire."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Quality controls:"]," Include platform-compliant attention checks, speeder detection, straight-line detection, open-end gibberish screening, and checks for implausible gaming behavior. Use short screens, minimal grids, fully labeled five-point scales, behavioral validation, and tap-friendly response formats for smartphone completion."],"\n"],[[88,208]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"4. Target Audience Profile"],[[88,211]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Who we are asking:"]," Indian mobile gamers spanning frequent, occasional, and lapsed players; current Fortnite players; players of competing battle royale titles; and relevant parents or household decision-makers for younger players where permission and platform policy allow."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Behavioral coverage:"]," Include players across different session frequencies, play durations, multiplayer patterns, game genres, platform mixes, recent game switching, uninstalling and returning, and in-app-purchase behavior."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Competitive relevance:"]," Ensure the audience includes people with direct experience of Fortnite and competing games such as BGMI/PUBG, Free Fire, and Apex Legends, rather than relying only on general gaming awareness."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Why these people hold the answers:"]," Current players can assess Fortnite’s live experience and loyalty drivers; lapsed players can explain churn and re-entry barriers; competitor players reveal conquest opportunities; and household decision-makers can illuminate spending permissions and perceptions around younger players."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Must-have screening criteria:"]," Recent mobile gaming activity; sufficient familiarity with at least one tracked game or gaming brand; ability to identify the games they currently or recently play; and, for player-level modules, a minimum recent usage threshold that is consistent across waves."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Indian segmentation lens:"]," Analyze results by metro and tier-1/2/3 location, region, NCCS, age band, gaming frequency, current Fortnite usage, competing-game usage, and payer versus non-payer status. These are audience cuts supplied or enforced through the platform’s targeting system where applicable."],"\n"],[[88,244]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"5. Key Information Areas & Data Architecture"],[[88,247]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Category and platform behavior:"]," Capture mobile gaming frequency, session length, time of day, genres, titles, and platform use → reveals the size and habits of the addressable gaming audience → informs channel planning and audience prioritization."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Unaided and aided brand funnel:"]," Measure spontaneous awareness first, followed by aided awareness, familiarity, consideration, current usage, recent usage, and likelihood to continue → shows where Fortnite and Epic Games win or lose in the funnel → guides brand-building and acquisition strategy."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Competitive repertoire and switching:"]," Record games played alongside Fortnite, recent switching, uninstalling, returning, and reasons for movement → identifies competitive displacement and retention risks → supports conquest, win-back, and product communication decisions."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Brand associations and differentiation:"]," Measure perceptions such as fun, social connection, creativity, variety, competitiveness, cultural relevance, trust, value, and distinctiveness → explains what Fortnite owns versus what competitors own → guides positioning, partnerships, and campaign messaging."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Live-service engagement:"]," Track awareness and participation in seasonal updates, limited-time events, collaborations, creator-made experiences, esports, and community activities → identifies which ecosystem elements strengthen engagement → informs partnership and content investment."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Social and community behavior:"]," Measure squad play, friend invitations, voice or text interaction, creator influence, sharing, streaming, and community participation → reveals the social mechanisms behind retention and advocacy → supports community and creator strategy."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"In-app purchase behavior:"]," Measure payer status, purchase frequency, recent purchase occasion, broad INR spend bands, purchase categories, perceived value, and barriers → links monetisation to engagement and brand perceptions → informs cosmetic, collaboration, offer, and value communication strategy."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Loyalty and advocacy:"]," Track likelihood to continue, recommend, invite friends, return after a break, and choose Fortnite over alternatives → provides leading indicators of retention and organic growth → supports investment decisions and wave-to-wave performance evaluation."],"\n"],[[88,290]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"6. Survey Flow & Question Design Approach"],[[88,293]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 1 — Warm-up and Screening:"]," Establish recent mobile gaming behavior, frequency, platforms, and relevant game usage. Use behavior-based qualification before asking brand opinions."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 2 — Category Context:"]," Measure genres played, battle royale participation, session patterns, social play, and game repertoire. This creates the competitive context before Fortnite or Epic Games are named in detail."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 3 — Unaided Brand Health:"]," Capture unaided awareness of gaming companies, games, and battle royale titles, followed by spontaneous associations and top-of-mind consideration."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 4 — Aided Funnel and Competitive Benchmarking:"]," Measure aided awareness, familiarity, consideration, current usage, recent usage, preference, perceived differentiation, and brand associations for Epic Games, Fortnite, and selected competitors."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 5 — Fortnite Engagement Deep Dive:"]," Among relevant respondents, assess play frequency, session behavior, multiplayer participation, seasonal content, collaborations, creator experiences, community behavior, switching, uninstalling, and returning."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 6 — Monetisation and Value:"]," Measure whether respondents make in-app purchases, recent purchase behavior, broad INR spend bands, purchase motivations, value perceptions, and barriers. Use optional-feeling wording for spend questions and avoid making payment behavior feel judgmental."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 7 — Loyalty, Advocacy, and Open Ends:"]," Measure likelihood to continue, recommend, invite friends, return, and choose Fortnite over alternatives. End with short open-ended probes on the strongest reason to play, the biggest frustration, and one change that would increase engagement."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Phase 8 — Rotating Wave Module:"]," Add a small wave-specific module for a campaign, collaboration, seasonal event, creator initiative, or competitive development. Keep this separate from the stable tracking core so trend KPIs remain comparable."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Estimated structure:"]," A smartphone-friendly instrument of approximately 15–25 questions, designed for an 8–12 minute completion window. The final question count will depend on routing between current players, lapsed players, competitor players, non-payers, payers, and parents or household decision-makers."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Scale design:"]," Prefer fully labeled five-point unipolar scales, behavioral frequency questions, forced trade-offs where useful, and short open-ended probes. Avoid long agree/disagree grids because positive-end responding and acquiescence can inflate apparent brand strength."],"\n"],[[88,346]],["H3",{"class":"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#464646] mt-4 mb-2","node":"[object Object]"},"7. Expected Insights & Business Decisions Enabled"],[[88,349]],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Track unaided and aided awareness, familiarity, consideration, usage, loyalty, advocacy, and perceived differentiation for Epic Games and Fortnite across waves."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Identify which Indian gamer segments are most engaged with Fortnite, which are drifting toward competitors, and which are high-potential non-users."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Diagnose whether changes in loyalty are linked to play frequency, social participation, seasonal content, collaborations, creator experiences, value perceptions, or competitive activity."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to:"]," Quantify the role of in-app purchases, broad INR spending behavior, cosmetic value, and collaboration-driven excitement in engagement and retention."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Which audiences should receive priority in marketing and campaign planning."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Which partnerships, collaborations, creator programs, and community initiatives are most aligned with the strongest engagement drivers."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Whether Fortnite’s positioning should emphasize social play, creativity, competition, cultural relevance, live events, variety, or another differentiated strength."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"You will be able to decide:"]," Where retention, win-back, and competitive-conquest activity should be focused."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Key hypotheses being tested:"],"\n",["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 mb-3 flex flex-col gap-1","node":"[object Object]"},"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Fortnite has stronger spontaneous awareness than most competing battle royale titles among active Indian mobile gamers."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Fortnite’s differentiation is driven more by its ecosystem, collaborations, creativity, and social experience than by battle royale gameplay alone."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Frequent multiplayer and community participation are associated with stronger loyalty and advocacy."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Seasonal updates and collaborations increase engagement, but their effect may be stronger among existing players than among lapsed or competitor-only players."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Spending is influenced by perceived cosmetic and event value, not only by play frequency."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},"Lapsed players are more likely to return when the trigger is a major update, collaboration, friend invitation, or new content experience."],"\n"],"\n"],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"KPIs to report:"]," Unaided awareness; aided awareness; familiarity; consideration; current usage; recent usage; usage frequency; competitive repertoire; Fortnite share of recent play; switch-in and switch-out rates; key association scores; differentiation index; likelihood to continue; recommendation and advocacy indicators; multiplayer participation; seasonal or collaboration engagement; payer incidence; recent purchase incidence; broad spend bands; value perception; and top reasons for switching, returning, or purchasing."],"\n",["LI",{"class":"leading-[150%]","node":"[object Object]"},["STRONG",{"class":"font-bold text-[#464646]","node":"[object Object]"},"Tracking outputs:"]," Report absolute wave scores, wave-over-wave movement, competitor gaps, segment differences, and driver relationships. Interpret changes against field timing and major gaming-market events rather than treating every movement as a permanent brand shift."],"\n"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],[[48,378]]]]]]],[[57,414]],[[24,421]],[[168,75]],[[473,191]]]]]],[[57,441]]]]]]]]]],[[489,507]],[[489,508]],[[489,509]]],[[489,656]],[[455,151]],[[473,236]],[[455,152]],[[88,479]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":232026.354,"wallTime":1786696121001,"collectionTime":4.899999976158142,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
