l in-app purchases, making loyalty broader than gameplay frequency alone. (","economictimes.indiatimes.com",", ","play.google.com",")"],"\n",["HR"],"\n",["H3",{"node":"[object Object]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex-shrink-0 gap-[8px] flex items-center","style":"transform: translateZ(0px);"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/icons/asterisk.svg","alt":"star icon","class":"hchat-icon flex-shrink-0","src":"/icons/asterisk.svg","style":"width: 18px; height: 18px; min-width: 18px; min-height: 18px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; will-change: transform;"}],["DIV",{},["STRONG",{},"Research Objectives"]]]],"\n",["P",{},"Based on the approved strategic framework, this study will address the following business objectives."],"\n",["H4",{},["STRONG",{},"Strategic Objectives"]],"\n",["OL",{},"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Measure"]," the strength of Epic Games and Fortnite’s brand-health funnel among Indian mobile gamers in order to guide brand, acquisition, retention, and competitive strategy."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Quantify"]," Fortnite’s position within the Indian battle royale ecosystem in order to identify opportunities for growth, conquest, and win-back."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Determine"]],"\n"]],[[12,492]]]]]],[[12,497]],[[12,498]]]]]]]],[[196,75]],[[501,191]]]]]],[[12,521]]]]]]]]]],[[517,507]],[[517,508]],[[517,509]]],[[517,656]],[[483,151]],[[501,236]],[[483,152]],[[116,479]],[[12,531]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":267224.23,"wallTime":1786696156200,"collectionTime":2.699999988079071,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
