",{},["STRONG",{},"Question Flow & Survey Phases"]]]],"\n",["UL",{},"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Phase 1 — Warm-Up & Screening:"]," Confirm recent mobile gaming activity, gaming frequency, platform use, and familiarity with at least one tracked title. This establishes eligibility without beginning with brand judgments."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Phase 2 — Category Usage & Competitive Context:"]," Measure genres played, session patterns, multiplayer behavior, game repertoire, time of day, recent switching, uninstalling, and returning. This provides the behavioral context for brand analysis."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Phase 3 — Unaided Brand Health:"]," Capture spontaneous awareness of gaming companies, games, battle royale titles, and associations before showing or naming detailed brand lists."],"\n",["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Phase 4 — Aided Funnel & Competitive Benchmarking:"]," Measure aided awareness, familiarity, consideration, current usage, recent usage, prefere"],"\n"]],[[40,492]]]]]],[[40,497]],[[40,498]]]]]]]],[[224,75]],[[529,191]]]]]],[[40,521]]]]]]]]]],[[545,507]],[[545,508]],[[545,509]]],[[545,656]],[[511,151]],[[529,236]],[[511,152]],[[144,479]],[[40,531]]]],"viewport":{"width":1280,"height":720},"timestamp":302415.336,"wallTime":1786696191391,"collectionTime":4.9000000059604645,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
