=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"The instrument is being designed."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The routing compilation layer is active — Hercules is translating abstract routing rules into concrete logic tied to actual question IDs, ensuring the survey behaves correctly in the field."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["H3",{},"Survey ready"],"\n",["P",{},"The survey draft ",["STRONG",{},"“Is Fortnite Winning India’s Gamers?”"]," is ready with ",["STRONG",{},"22 respondent-facing questions"],". It follows the approved zero-stimulus tracking design and is structured for consistent measurement across future waves."],"\n",["H3",{},"Research strategy"],"\n",["P",{},"This is a ",["STRONG",{},"brand health tracker"]," for Epic Games and Fortnite among Indian mobile gamers, combining brand equity, competitive benchmarking, usage, engagement, loyalty, advocacy, switching, social play, and monetisation measures. Wave-level results will help the business understand where Fortnite is gaining or losing salience, usage, preference, loyalty, advocacy, and competitive share—and guide acquisition, retention, win-back, and growth priorities."],"\n",["H3",{},"Survey structure"],"\n",["P",{},"Respondents move through the mandated brand-equity funnel: ",["STRONG",{},"unaided recall"],", followed by aided awareness and non-aware termination; ",["STRONG",{},"familiarity and usage"],"; ",["STRONG",{},"perception and equity"],"; ",["STRONG",{},"emotional connection"],"; and finally ",["STRONG",{},"loyalty and advocacy"],". The questionnaire is organised across Salience, Familiarity & Usage, Perception Equity, Emotional Connection, and Loyalty & Advocacy while keeping core wording, brand lists, scales, and KPI definitions stable for tracking."],"\n",["H3",{},"Routing & logic"],"\n",["P",{},"Smart branching and screening logic are built in: ",["STRONG",{},"1 routing rule"]," handles the required branching and screening gates, and ",["STRONG",{},"1 dynamic carry-forward filter"]," helps tailor follow-up responses based on earlier answers."],"\n",["H3",{},"Review invitation"],"\n",["P",{},"Please review the draft and let me know if you would like any wording, response options, brand lists, KPI treatment, or routing logic refined before launch."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full mb-[32px]"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"opacity-100 flex py-[7px] border-[.8px] cursor-pointer mt-7 rounded-[14px] w-full justify-between relative transition-colors duration-200 overflow-hidden pb-4","tabindex":"0","style":"background-color: rgb(240, 249, 244); border-color: rgb(209, 226, 214);"},["DIV",{"class":"w-full"},["DIV",{"class":"flex justify-between items-center w-full border-b border-[#D1E2D6]  mb-4 z-50"},["DIV",{"class":"py-2 md:py-[5px] pl-4 md:pl-[10px] pr-[14px] bg-[#DDF0E5] border-[#D1E2D6] text-[#608770]  font-normal text-[16px] md:text-[12px] tracking-[-0.02em] rounded-t-[12px] ml-6 border-[.6px] border-b-0  md:-mb-[1px] "},"Survey is In-drafts"],["DIV",{"class":"flex ga