th; }\n.ws-spin-anim { animation: ws-spin 0.7s linear infinite; }\n/* Header icon shimmer — exactly synced with the title ShimmerText: same gradient\n   (#B8B8B8 base, #464646 sweeping highlight), same background-size, same keyframe\n   and 3s timing. The icon SVG is the mask, so the gradient fills the icon's\n   shape (replaces its color while streaming, mirroring the text clip). */\n.ws-icon-shimmer {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #464646 0%, #464646 50%, #B8B8B8 75%, #464646 100%);\n  background-size: 200% 100%;\n  animation: ws-shimmer-sweep 3s linear infinite;\n}\n/* Recolorable icon — a single masked span whose background-color IS the icon\n   color. Two clear states: mid-gray #6B6B6B at rest, darkening to the text's\n   hover color #343434 on header hover. (Matching the text's #464646→#343434\n   exactly was imperceptible — text hover reads via font-weight, icons can't do\n   that, so they need a wider color gap.) One element for both states, so the\n   icon's size/position can't shift on hover. */\n.ws-icon-tint {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-mask-size: contain; mask-size: contain;\n  -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n  -webkit-mask-position: center; mask-position: center;\n  background-color: #6B6B6B;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.group:hover .ws-icon-tint { background-color: #343434; }\n.ws-scroll { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #B0B0B0 #ECECEC; overscroll-behavior-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-y; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; -webkit-appearance: none; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #ECECEC; border-radius: 4px; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #B0B0B0; border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #ECECEC; }\n.ws-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #9A9A9A; }\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","aria-expanded":"false","class":"group flex items-center cursor-pointer select-none"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[6px]"},["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block flex-shrink-0","style":"width: 13px; height: 13px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/leaf.svg\");"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_mono_dc771075-module__pIk42a__className flex items-center gap-[3px] text-[13px] font-normal leading-[140%] tracking-normal allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"font-normal text-[#464646] group-hover:font-medium group-hover:text-[#343434] transition-colors duration-200"},"The conditional logic — being wired to the actual questions"]]],["SPAN",{"class":"relative inline-block self-center flex-shrink-0 ml-[4px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 scale-y-100 transition-[transform,opacity] duration-300","style":"width: 15px; height: 15px;"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true","class":"ws-icon-tint","style":"mask-image: url(\"/icons/down_chevron.svg\");"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 0fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"ml-[16px] mt-4 mb-[10px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 pb-[10px]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"Goals, audience, methodology — all in one place."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The survey flow is being mapped — Hercules is establishing the structure of the study: which sections will appear, in what order, and how the logical sequence of the instrument will serve the research objectives."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 pb-[10px]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"The research plan is being put together."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The routing logic is being mapped — Hercules is establishing the branching paths through the instrument and defining the conditions that determine who gets routed where."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 pb-[10px]"},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"The survey is being built — deliberately and in full."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"Hercules is generating the questions — working from the brief and the research design to produce a survey calibrated to the target respondent."]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex gap-[8px] min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col items-center flex-shrink-0 w-4"},["SPAN",{"class":"flex items-center justify-center w-4 h-4"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://dev.hercules.works/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75","alt":"done","loading":"lazy","width":"14","height":"14","decoding":"async","data-nimg":"1","class":"ws-fade-in","srcset":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=16&q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75 2x","src":"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fws-tick.svg&w=32&q=75","style":"color: transparent; width: 14px; height: 14px;"}]],["SPAN",{"class":"w-px flex-1 my-[8px] min-h-[8px] bg-[#E1E1E1]"}]],["DIV",{"class":"min-w-0 flex-1 "},["DIV",{"class":"flex items-center gap-[4px] text-left min-h-4 cursor-default allow-text-select"},["SPAN",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className ws-fade-in font-medium text-[12px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-[#464646]"},"The instrument is being designed."]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out","style":"grid-template-rows: 1fr;"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden min-w-0"},["DIV",{"class":"pt-[6px] allow-text-select"},["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col gap-[2px] mb-[18px]"},["P",{"class":"roboto_9f186078-module__bqURWG__className text-[12px] leading-[140%] text-[#464646] font-normal"},"The routing compilation layer is active — Hercules is translating abstract routing rules into concrete logic tied to actual question IDs, ensuring the survey behaves correctly in the field."]]]]]]]]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full overflow-x-visible"},["DIV",{"class":"text-[#22252A]","style":"user-select: text; cursor: text; opacity: 1; transform: none;"},["DIV",{"class":"hchat hchat-md w-full"},["H3",{},"Survey ready"],"\n",["P",{},"The survey draft ",["STRONG",{},"“Is Fortnite Winning India’s Gamers?”"]," is ready with ",["STRONG",{},"22 respondent-facing questions"],". It follows the approved zero-stimulus tracking design and is structured for consistent measurement across future waves."],"\n",["H3",{},"Research strategy"],"\n",["P",{},"This is a ",["STRONG",{},"brand health tracker"]," for Epic Games and Fortnite among Indian mobile gamers, combining brand equity, competitive benchmarking, usage, engagement, loyalty, advocacy, switching, social play, and monetisation measures. Wave-level results will help the business understand where Fortnite is gaining or losing salience, usage, preference, loyalty, advocacy, and competitive share—and guide acquisition, retention, win-back, and growth priorities."],"\n",["H3",{},"Survey structure"],"\n",["P",{},"Respondents move through the mandated brand-equity funnel: ",["STRONG",{},"unaided recall"],", followed by aided awareness and non-aware termination; ",["STRONG",{},"familiarity and usage"],"; ",["STRONG",{},"perception and equity"],"; ",["STRONG",{},"emotional connection"],"; and finally ",["STRONG",{},"loyalty and advocacy"],". The questionnaire is organised across Salience, Familiarity & Usage, Perception Equity, Emotional Connection, and Loyalty & Advocacy while keeping core wording, brand lists, scales, and KPI definitions stable for tracking."],"\n",["H3",{},"Routing & logic"],"\n",["P",{},"Smart branching and screening logic are built in: ",["STRONG",{},"1 routing rule"]," handles the required branching and screening gates, and ",["STRONG",{},"1 dynamic carry-forward filter"]," helps tailor follow-up responses based on earlier answers."],"\n",["H3",{},"Review invitation"],"\n",["P",{},"Please review the draft and let me know if you would like any wording, response options, brand lists, KPI treatment, or routing logic refined before launch."]]],["DIV"],["DIV",{"class":"flex flex-col w-full mb-[6px]"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"clas